  "question": {
    "text": "A circuit is connected as shown in the figure with the switch $S$ open. When the switch is closed, the total amount of charge that flows from $Y$ to $X$ is\n<img src=\"https://cdn-question-pool.getmarks.app/pyq/jee_advanced/gVNmoMqCTlpc9kjg3AHBkN3h3FpoDB_xQ_LN2wyvCFU.original.fullsize.png\"><br>",
    "image": null
  },
  "options": [
    {
      "id": "1ccGP",
      "text": "\nzero\n",
      "image": null,
      "isCorrect": false
    },
    {
      "id": "axtuN",
      "text": "\n$54 \\mu \\mathrm{C}$\n",
      "image": null,
      "isCorrect": false
    },
    {
      "id": "o213e",
      "text": "\n$27 \\mu \\mathrm{C}$\n",
      "image": null,
      "isCorrect": true
    },
    {
      "id": "mJGvG",
      "text": "\n$81 \\mu \\mathrm{C}$",
      "image": null,
      "isCorrect": false
    }
  ],
  "correctValue": null,
  "solution": {
    "text": "From $Y$ to $X$ charge flows to plates $a$ and $b$.\n$$\n\\left(q_0+q_b\\right)_i=0,\\left(q_0+q_b\\right)_f=27 \\mu \\mathrm{C}\n$$\n<img src=\"https://cdn-question-pool.getmarks.app/pyq/jee_advanced/U9y-IpNMTnta5hFfTFwh-2QOoznAart4eldMPFAg-5M.original.fullsize.png\"><br><img src=\"https://cdn-question-pool.getmarks.app/pyq/jee_advanced/qLd1-LHBQQ3Yec5ukMhmKqut2Kcs75i6baaqnE6p4O8.original.fullsize.png\"><br>\n$\\therefore 27 \\mu \\mathrm{C}$ charge flows from $Y$ to $X$.\n$\\therefore$ Correct option is (c)",
    "image": null
  },
